## Open points for ruling (one, defaults chosen)

1. **The H2 gate keys on `active_cap == NONE` alone, per the ruling — no
   `card` conjunct.** Off-card, the twin mint at `:11497` is `card && …`,
   so an off-card NONE emission would put its ONLY body (no twin exists
   there) in the uncounted list — its bake's total would drop the body's
   trips too. I read the only NONE call site (`:13409`, the serial
   prefix-free ladder) as card-path-only, so the case is unreachable;
   flagging so the audit confirms rather than assumes. If it is reachable
   and wrong, the gate gains `&& card`.

## Behavior delta

No green build changes semantically: nothing emitted, staged, compiled,
or selectable changes — only the census's whole-bake number and the total
door's input drop the primary split's counted trips. The 256 rung's door
moves from ≈97-102k (REFUSE ⇒ empty ladder ⇒ window guard fails the
build) to ≈49-51k — GREEN with headroom. The 512 rung still refuses at
the body door `:11438-11443` (the per-bundle wall inside `emit_bundle`
at render, pre-ticket, flag-ungated) — the ladder tops at 256 until
fusion brings the 512 body under 65,536, depth from run-48's measured
census. The uncounted primary still COMPILES: the cold clock against the
6-10 minute law judges that, not the door.
